<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for right triangle" class="sr-only"><ul><li>One angle is a right angle.</li><li>The measure of the other 2 angles are as follows:<br><ul><li>45°</li><li>45°</li></ul></li><li>The lengths of the 2 sides adjacent to the right angle are as follows:<br><ul><li>x</li><li>24</li></ul></li><li>Note: Figure not drawn to scale.</li></ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">In the triangle shown, what is the value of <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
</math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"d841bf0c-037c-4a9c-9ed2-4cd4cad575f7","content":"<p><math alttext=\"24\"><mn>24</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"4c27d95c-2c77-4da9-a799-6a8b61f41175","content":"<p><math alttext=\"45\"><mn>45</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"4b9e8a04-9f1f-4bf9-b915-14a795e95069","content":"<p><math alttext=\"48\"><mn>48</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"acbc3864-15a2-47f4-acc0-9aacdd21a0a9","content":"<p><math alttext=\"69\"><mn>69</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["A"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["d841bf0c-037c-4a9c-9ed2-4cd4cad575f7"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is correct. Since the two acute angles have the same measure and the third angle is a right angle, the triangle shown is an isosceles right triangle. In an isosceles right triangle, the two legs have the same length. The figure shows that the length of one leg of the triangle is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="24"><mn>24</mn></math> and the length of the other leg of the triangle is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x"><mi>x</mi></math>. It follows that the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x"><mi>x</mi></math> is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="24"><mn>24</mn></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. This is the measure, in degrees, of one of the angles shown.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"145337bc","external_id":"7e480092-1ead-484d-8b6f-5c6417fa9d9f","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"ed1fc850-11d4-4c77-a35a-a2d48724b115","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"S","domain":"Geometry and Trigonometry","skill_cd":"S.C.","skill_desc":"Right triangles and trigonometry","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":3,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"250.0pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 250.0 210.0\" height=\"210.0pt\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A right triangle. Refer to long description.\">\n  <g>\n    <g><defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 200.239875  L 244.8 200.239875  L 244.8 -0  L 0 -0  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 190.368  L 237.6 190.368  L 237.6 7.2  L 7.2 7.2  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"text_1\">\n    <!-- $24$ -->\n    <defs>\n     <path d=\"M 47.40625 13.703125  L 42 0  L 2.90625 0  L 2.90625 1.203125  L 20.703125 20.09375  Q 27.703125 27.40625 30.703125 33.5  Q 33.703125 39.59375 33.703125 46.09375  Q 33.703125 52.796875 30 56.5  Q 26.296875 60.203125 19.796875 60.203125  Q 14.40625 60.203125 11.25 57.390625  Q 8.09375 54.59375 5.09375 47.203125  L 3 47.703125  Q 4.703125 57 9.84375 62.296875  Q 15 67.59375 23.796875 67.59375  Q 32.09375 67.59375 37.1875 62.59375  Q 42.296875 57.59375 42.296875 50  Q 42.296875 38.703125 29.5 25.203125  L 13 7.59375  L 3