<li>Counterclockwise from top right, the lines are labeled s, r, q, and t.</li>
<li>Line s intersects line r above line q.</li>
<li>Line s and line r each intersect line q and line t.</li>
<li>At the intersection of line s and line r, 1 angle is labeled counterclockwise from top as follows:<br>
