<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for right triangle" class="sr-only"><ul><li>One angle is a right angle.</li>
<li>The measure of a second angle is x°.</li>
<li>The length of the hypotenuse is 28.</li>
<li>The length of the leg adjacent to the angle with measure x° is 11.</li>
<li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li>
</ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">In the triangle shown, what is the value of <math alttext="cosine x degree"><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math>?</p>$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$[".3928",".3929","11/28"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$[".3928",".3929","11/28"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The correct answer is <math alttext="StartFraction 11 Over 28 EndFraction"><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac></math>. The cosine of an acute angle in a right triangle is defined as the ratio of the length of the leg adjacent to the angle to the length of the hypotenuse. In the triangle shown, the length of the leg adjacent to the angle with measure&nbsp;<math alttext="x degree"><mi>x</mi><mo>&deg;</mo></math> is <math alttext="11"><mn>11</mn>
</math> units and the length of the hypotenuse is <math alttext="28"><mn>28</mn>
</math> units. Therefore, the value of <math alttext="cosine x degree"><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&deg;</mo></math>&nbsp;is <math alttext="StartFraction 11 Over 28 EndFraction"><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac></math>. Note that 11/28, .3928, .3929, 0.392, and 0.393 are examples of ways to enter a correct answer.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"1bf809b5","external_id":"9312f237-66e1-4380-a28d-185ceec5d2ab","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"e8b0ddce-aa75-4294-af20-abda74ba28bb","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"S","domain":"Geometry and Trigonometry","skill_cd":"S.C.","skill_desc":"Right triangles and trigonometry","difficulty":"H","score_band_range_cd":6,"type":"spr","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"250.0pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 250.0 210.0\" height=\"210.0pt\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A right triangle. Refer to long description.\">\n  <g>\n    <g><defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 197.568  L 244.8 197.568  L 244.8 0  L 0 0  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 190.368  L 237.6 190.368  L 237.6 7.2  L 7.2 7.2  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"text_1\">\n    <!-- $11$ -->\n    <defs>\n     <path d=\"M 39.40625 0  L 11.796875 0  L 11.796875 1.5  Q 17.296875 1.796875 19.296875 3.546875  Q 21.296875 5.296875 21.296875 9.5  L 21.296875 54.40625  Q 21.296875 59.296875 18.296875 59.296875  Q 16.90625 59.296875 13.796875 58.09375  L 11.09375 57.09375  L 11.09375 58.5  L 29 67.59375  L 29.90625 67.296875 